  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.1.0: First release. McpContract.CheckAsync with 26 rules (TTS-MCP-001 to TTS-MCP-026) over the server, its tools, prompts and instructions, probes that call tools and check the answers (ProbeError tells a crash from a refusal), per-rule and per-target waivers and severity overrides, McpContractReport.EnsureNoErrors for any test framework; McpTestServer for in-memory servers and McpTestClient for remote ones.\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/TechTeaStudio/Mcp/blob/product/CHANGELOG.md",
